    "taught": false
   },
   {
    "tag": "fr-CH",
    "label": "Switzerland",
    "taught": false
   }
  ],
  "avoid": [
   "Québec meal names (déjeuner = breakfast, dîner = lunch, souper = dinner); use le petit-déjeuner, le déjeuner, le dîner",
   "Belgian/Swiss numbers septante, huitante, nonante; use soixante-dix, quatre-vingts, quatre-vingt-dix",
   "Spoken negation without ne (je comprends pas)",
   "Spanish punctuation ¿ ¡ and the letter ñ",
   "Calques from the Spanish source (je reste content for estoy contento; use je suis content)"
  ]
 },
